### 토큰 변수 (로그인 후 발급받은 토큰 붙여넣기)
@access_token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IlJPTEVfVVNFUiIsImlhdCI6MTc5MTUyMTA1MSwiZXhwIjoxNzkxNTIxOTUxfQ._TMpofecOjUr3zK9KE1ATGD7j1BigKawxyT6MZz-kOFcBZ-ieu6epn6W3XbohPAt

### ──────────────────────────────
### 1. 계좌 등록 (입출금 통장)
### ──────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "카카오뱅크 입출금",
  "type": "CHECKING",
  "balance": 1000000,
  "currency": "KRW"
}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 2. 계좌 등록 (저축 계좌)
### ──────────────────────────────
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "토스 저축",
  "type": "SAVINGS",
  "balance": 500000,
  "currency": "KRW"
}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 3. 내 계좌 목록 조회
### ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 4. 계좌 단건 조회
### ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 5. 계좌 수정
### ──────────────────────────────
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "카카오뱅크 수정",
  "type": "CHECKING"
}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 6. 잔액 수동 조정 (50,000원 추가)
### ──────────────────────────────
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 50000
}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 7. 잔액 수동 조정 (30,000원 차감)
### ──────────────────────────────
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -30000
}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 8. 타인 계좌 접근 시도 (보안 확인)
### ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/999
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 9. 계좌 삭제
### ──────────────────────────────
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### ──────────────────────────────
### 10. 삭제된 계좌 조회 (실패해야 정상)
### ──────────────────────────────
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/2
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}